title: $:/mf/gen/Panel/file panel
catalog: Panel
target: file panel
summary: The file panel type

!! Commands

* ``file:back`` — File: go up one level (out of a listing, or to the containing folder)
* ``file:mute`` — File: mute / unmute
* ``file:page`` — File: go to a page of the document
* ``file:play-pause`` — File: play / pause the media
* ``file:restart`` — File: play the media from the start
* ``file:seek`` — File: seek the previewed media by a signed number of seconds (e.g. +${SEEK_STEP}, -${SEEK_STEP_LONG})
* ``file:speed`` — File: step the playback rate
* ``file:toggle`` — File: toggle a view flag
* ``file:volume`` — File: step the volume
* ``file:zoom`` — File: zoom the previewed image/video
